No, it's not done.

114
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:07,420
Don't overcook it. You overcook it, it's no good.

115
00:09:08,530 --> 00:09:10,650
It defeats its own purpose.

116
00:09:14,900 --> 00:09:17,500
What are you doin'? I just said don't overcook it.

117
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:19,660
You're overcookin' it, bring it over.

118
00:09:19,770 --> 00:09:21,830
- You want your steak? - Bring it over.

119
00:09:22,540 --> 00:09:24,070
Bring it over!

120
00:09:24,180 --> 00:09:27,270
It's like a piece of charcoal! Bring it over here!

121
00:09:27,380 --> 00:09:29,780
- You want your steak? - Yeah, right now!

122
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:32,550
Good. There's your stupid steak.

123
00:09:32,650 --> 00:09:35,120
- Can't wait for it to be done? - No, I can't wait.

124
00:09:35,220 --> 00:09:37,210
Good. Okay? Happy?

125
00:09:37,320 --> 00:09:38,880
- Happy? - That's all I want.

126
00:09:38,990 --> 00:09:40,860
That's... there, no, more. There.

127
00:09:41,860 --> 00:09:45,560
Botherin' me about a steak, huh? You're botherin' me about a steak?

128
00:09:45,670 --> 00:09:47,630
I agree with you. He should be with Tommy.

129
00:09:47,740 --> 00:09:50,570
If he's in a good mood, I'll talk to him. What the fuck you want me to do?

130
00:09:50,670 --> 00:09:52,470
Tommy tells me every day to talk to you

131
00:09:52,570 --> 00:09:54,060
and speak to Jake to straighten this thing out,

132
00:09:54,180 --> 00:09:55,700
I'm gonna wind up in the middle.

133
00:09:55,810 --> 00:09:57,110
You're in the middle? I'm his brother.

134
00:09:57,210 --> 00:09:59,410
- He's got me fuckin' nuts. - You're his brother.

135
00:09:59,510 --> 00:10:01,880
If you can't talk to him, who's gonna talk to him?

136
00:10:03,590 --> 00:10:05,490
- I'll talk to him. - Do what you can, that's all.

137
00:10:05,590 --> 00:10:07,320
- That's all I'm askin' you. - I'll see you tomorrow.

138
00:10:07,420 --> 00:10:09,720
- Let me go up. - All right? Where you gonna be?

139
00:10:09,820 --> 00:10:11,820
I'll be at the gym or the other joint, one of the two.

140
00:10:11,930 --> 00:10:13,830
- I'll catch you by the gym. - All right. Sal?

141
00:10:13,930 --> 00:10:14,920
Yeah?

142
00:10:17,700 --> 00:10:19,830
Complain some more, I wanna hear.

143
00:10:19,940 --> 00:10:22,840
- Complain? You call those carrots? - That's right.

144
00:10:22,940 --> 00:10:24,770
- You call that food? - You ate 'em. Did you eat them?

145
00:10:24,870 --> 00:10:26,570
You call that food? I got no choice!

146
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:28,370
- I'm sick of you already! - I got no choice!

147
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:32,350
- I can't believe you! - I got no choice!

148
00:10:32,450 --> 00:10:35,010
You got no choice? Get away from me!

149
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:37,420
- Please! - Get in there. Get in there!

150
00:10:37,520 --> 00:10:40,110
Get your hands off me, get away from me!

151
00:10:40,220 --> 00:10:42,120
Fuck! I'm sick of you!

152
00:10:42,230 --> 00:10:44,250
What's the matter with you, you animals?

153
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,920
- What? - Jack, come on!

154
00:10:46,030 --> 00:10:48,020
- You animals! - Come on, huh?

155
00:10:48,130 --> 00:10:50,260
This son of a bitch is callin' me an animal.

156
00:10:50,370 --> 00:10:52,770
- Hey, you! - Come on, Jack.

157
00:10:52,870 --> 00:10:55,530
I'm gonna get hold of that dog, and I'm gonna eat it for lunch!

158
00:10:55,640 --> 00:10:58,070
You hear what I'm sayin'? You hear me, Larry?

159
00:10:58,180 --> 00:11:01,370
- Larry? - Crazy animal!

160
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:03,950
Who's an animal? Your mother's an animal!

161
00:11:04,050 --> 00:11:05,910
You son of a bitch!

162
00:11:06,020 --> 00:11:09,080
You're gonna find your dog dead in the hallway tomorrow, ya bum.

163
00:11:09,190 --> 00:11:10,650
- I can't take it! - The whole block,

164
00:11:10,750 --> 00:11:12,810
- people could hear you. - I'll kill the whole family.

165
00:11:12,920 --> 00:11:14,480
- Sit down, relax. - I can't take this anymore!

166
00:11:14,590 --> 00:11:16,490
You break anything in there, I'm gonna kill ya!

167
00:11:16,590 --> 00:11:19,390
I swear to God, I'm gonna come in there and kill ya.

168
00:11:19,500 --> 00:11:20,960
Yeah, sure.

169
00:11:23,940 --> 00:11:25,230
You wanna calm down?

170
00:11:27,270 --> 00:11:28,240
Oh, fuck!

171
