My hands.

184
00:12:15,590 --> 00:12:18,390
Your hands? What about 'em?

185
00:12:20,260 --> 00:12:23,890
I got these small hands. I got a little girl's hands.

186
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:26,130
I got 'em, too. What's the difference?

187
00:12:28,270 --> 00:12:29,740
Know what that means?

188
00:12:30,940 --> 00:12:33,000
No matter how big I get, no matter who I fight,

189
00:12:33,110 --> 00:12:36,570
