206
00:13:27,500 --> 00:13:28,620
Hit me in the face. Go ahead.

207
00:13:28,730 --> 00:13:30,060
- No. - What, are you afraid?

208
00:13:30,170 --> 00:13:31,160
Afraid of what?

209
00:13:31,270 --> 00:13:33,570
Come on, don't be a little faggot, hit me.

210
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:37,510
- I ain't a fag. - Take your best shot, go ahead.

211
00:13:37,610 --> 00:13:40,840
Come on. You gotta be a real jerk, you want me to punch you in the face.

212
00:13:41,610 --> 00:13:45,010
Did I not tell you just to do it? Now I'm tellin' you, you gotta do it.

213
00:13:46,450 --> 00:13:47,580
I ain't hittin' ya.

214
00:13:47,680 --> 00:13:50,590
I'm your older brother, Joey. I'm tellin' ya somethin'.

215
00:13:50,690 --> 00:13:52,480
I know what you said. I ain't doin' it.

216
00:13:54,290 --> 00:13:56,260
I don't care if you get mad, I ain't doin' it.

217
00:13:57,460 --> 00:13:58,930
Fuckin' nut.

218
00:14:00,800 --> 00:14:02,860
I'm not doin' it, I'm not gonna do it.

219
00:14:04,070 --> 00:14:06,660
