220
00:14:06,770 --> 00:14:08,470
- I ain't doin' it. - Use that over there.

221
00:14:08,570 --> 00:14:11,700
- What? - That's right, use that.

222
00:14:12,810 --> 00:14:16,040
Wrap it around your hand! How many times I gotta tell you?

223
00:14:16,150 --> 00:14:17,880
- Not too many more. - Go ahead.

224
00:14:17,980 --> 00:14:18,660
You want me to hit you?

225
00:14:18,660 --> 00:14:19,280
I want you to hit me...

226
00:14:19,380 --> 00:14:22,480
... with everything you got. I want you to fuckin' lay me out, go ahead.

227
00:14:22,590 --> 00:14:23,550
- You sure? - Yeah.

228
00:14:23,660 --> 00:14:24,920
- Go ahead. - All right.

229
00:14:25,020 --> 00:14:27,120
- Harder. - Yeah?

230
00:14:27,230 --> 00:14:29,890
You throw a punch like you take it up the ass, come on.

231
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:31,660
Harder, harder.

232
00:14:31,760 --> 00:14:33,560
- Harder. - That's hard, you fuck.

233
00:14:33,670 --> 00:14:34,930
- What do you want? - Take it off.

234
00:14:35,070 --> 00:14:37,430
- Take it off. - Come on, you wanna stop now?

235
00:14:37,540 --> 00:14:38,800
- That's enough with that... - Take it off.

236
00:14:38,900 --> 00:14:40,030
Come on.

237
00:14:40,140 --> 00:14:41,270
- Come on. - Don't fuck around.

238
00:14:41,370 --> 00:14:42,970
- What are you, a girl? - Oh, girl, huh?

239
00:14:43,080 --> 00:14:44,700
I'm gonna smack you again, throw it again.

240
00:14:44,810 --> 00:14:45,900
- That's enough. - Go ahead.

241
00:14:46,010 --> 00:14:47,810
- I said that's enough! - Harder, harder.

242
00:14:47,910 --> 00:14:50,580
No, your fuckin' cuts are opening and everything.

243
00:14:51,120 --> 00:14:53,210
What are you tryin' to prove? What does it prove?

244
00:15:09,600 --> 00:15:10,830
