01:05:45,130 --> 01:05:47,570
he don't give a fuck, he's gonna do what he wants to do,

973
01:05:47,670 --> 01:05:50,690
he wants to make it on his own. He thinks he can make it on his own.

974
01:05:50,810 --> 01:05:52,100
Make it on his own.

975
01:05:52,210 --> 01:05:57,270
He thinks he's gonna walk in there and become champion on his own?

976
01:05:58,010 --> 01:06:00,850
- He's crazy. You know he's nuts. - Yeah, he's crazy.

977
01:06:00,950 --> 01:06:04,350
And he's got no respect for nobody, he doesn't listen to nobody.

978
01:06:04,450 --> 01:06:05,750
That's not crazy.

979
01:06:05,850 --> 01:06:09,260
- He respects you, though. - He doesn't respect anybody.

980
01:06:09,360 --> 01:06:11,480
Now, you do this for me, you understand?

981
01:06:11,590 --> 01:06:16,790
You tell him I don't care how colorful he is, how great he is.

982
01:06:16,900 --> 01:06:18,530
He could beat all the Sugar Ray Robinsons

983
01:06:18,630 --> 01:06:20,660
and the Tony Janiros in the world.

984
01:06:20,770 --> 01:06:24,330
But he ain't gonna get a shot at that title, not without us, he ain't.

985
01:06:25,170 --> 01:06:27,270
Now, you're a smart kid.

986
01:06:27,640 --> 01:06:29,770
You go to him, you tell him...

987
01:06:34,920 --> 01:06:36,210
Son of a bitch.

988
01:06:37,250 --> 01:06:38,880
Twenty dollar shoe here.

989
01:06:46,100 --> 01:06:48,060
Aren't you gonna ask me what happened?

990
01:06:52,270 --> 01:06:53,400
What's the matter?

991
01:06:56,110 --> 01:06:58,730
- What's wrong? - I remember when I met her here.

992
01:06:59,780 --> 01:07:01,900
- Who? - Vickie.

993
01:07:04,950 --> 01:07:07,920
Why, what's the matter? What'd she do now?

994
01:07:11,260 --> 01:07:14,190
I know she's doin' somethin', I just wanna catch her once.

995
01:07:14,290 --> 01:07:15,420
Just once.

996
01:07:19,030 --> 01:07:22,000
Hey, Jack. Wanna do yourself a favor?

997
01:07:22,530 --> 01:07:24,760
Bust her fuckin' hole, throw her out.

998
01:07:25,300 --> 01:07:27,860
Either that, or live with her and let her ruin your life,

999
01:07:27,970 --> 01:07:29,770
'cause that's what's happenin'.

1000
01:07:32,580 --> 01:07:35,550
How much could you take? How much shit could you take?

1001
01:07:45,420 --> 01:07:46,980
So, what'd that guy say?

1002
01:07:47,930 --> 01:07:50,560
He gave me the old "good news, bad news" routine.

1003
01:07:51,100 --> 01:07:52,150
The good news is

1004
01:07:52,260 --> 01:07:54,390
you're gonna get the shot at the title.

1005
01:07:54,500 --> 01:07:58,730
The bad news is they want you to do the old flip-flop for them.

1006
01:07:59,840 --> 01:08:01,830
- So, what else is new? - What'd you expect?

1007
01:08:01,940 --> 01:08:03,380
You didn't know that was comin'?

1008
01:08:04,440 --> 01:08:06,110
You win some, you lose some.

1009
01:08:06,210 --> 01:08:07,680
This one, we're losin'.

1010
01:08:10,020 --> 01:08:11,140
Billy Fox.

1011
01:08:11,690 --> 01:08:15,490
173 and 3/4 pounds.

1012
01:08:18,060 --> 01:08:22,360
- Jake La Motta. 167... - I guess you've heard by now

1013
01:08:22,460 --> 01:08:25,730
a lot of the stuff that's goin' around, a lot of rumors.

1014
01:08:26,270 --> 01:08:29,570
Matter of fact, a short time ago you were a big favorite,

1015
01:08:29,670 --> 01:08:32,040
and all of a sudden, you're a 12-5 underdog,

1016
01:08:32,140 --> 01:08:34,130
and people are talkin', it's as simple as that.

1017
01:08:34,240 --> 01:08:37,040
- That's funny, I never heard anything. - It's out there, though,

1018
01:08:37,140 --> 01:08:38,200
and It's not good.

1019
01:08:38,310 --> 01:08:40,280
As a matter of fact, the bets are off on this one.

1020
01:08:40,380 --> 01:08:42,210
Nothin' goin' in this one.

1021
01:08:42,320 --> 01:08:46,150
Matter of fact, smart money is sayin' that you're getting ready to hit the tank.

1022
01:08:46,250 --> 01:08:48,450
- That's bullshit. - Yeah, that's bullshit.

1023
01:08:49,420 --> 01:08:50,720
You got any money you wanna bet?

1024
01:08:50,830 --> 01:08:52,380
- Come on. - I'll take the action, go ahead.

1025
01:08:52,490 --> 01:08:55,290
You bet it on Fox, 'cause I'm gonna win.

1026
01:08:55,400 --> 01:08:57,730
There's no way I'm goin' down. I don't go down for nobody.

1027
01:08:57,830 --> 01:08:59,630
- That's what I wanted to hear. - I want you to know that.

1028
01:08:59,740 --> 01:09:01,200
- All right. - All right, Colonel.

1029
01:09:01,300 --> 01:09:02,790
Okay, that's it.

1030
01:09:02,900 --> 01:09:04,240
You came down here just for that nonsense?

1031
01:09:04,340 --> 01:09:06,030
- That was it? - That was it.

1032
01:09:16,490 --> 01:09:18,080
Good evening, ladies and gentlemen.

1033
01:09:18,190 --> 01:09:21,090
Welcome to the Madison Square Garden

1034
01:09:21,190 --> 01:09:23,280
feature attraction.

1035
01:09:23,390 --> 01:09:27,960
- In this corner, weighing 175 pounds... - Commissioner, how about a picture?

1036
01:09:28,060 --> 01:09:29,860
Fellas, can we get a picture over here?

1037
01:09:29,970 --> 01:09:33,770
...the undefeated Billy Fox.

1038
01:09:37,570 --> 01:09:39,630
Hi, Steve. Your brother got out of the hospital?

1039
01:09:39,740 --> 01:09:42,740
- They think it's all right. - Did he get out? Good.

1040
01:09:44,550 --> 01:09:47,020
- Charlie, let me sit over there. - Yeah, sure.

1041
01:09:48,420 --> 01:09:51,120
Tommy, what's the matter? Everything's all right?

1042
01:09:51,220 --> 01:09:52,650
It's all right, yeah.

1043
01:09:52,760 --> 01:09:54,420
Touch gloves now, come out boxing.

1044
01:09:54,530 --> 01:09:56,320
Five seconds, Alex.

1045
01:10:08,940 --> 01:10:11,640
Come on, stand... come on, stand up!

1046
01:10:11,740 --> 01:10:14,440
What the fuck you doin'? Hit me, ya fuckin' bum, come on.

1047
01:10:15,110 --> 01:10:16,240
Come on.

1048
01:10:16,880 --> 01:10:20,280
What are you doin', Jake? Come on, box him!

1049
01:10:30,130 --> 01:10:31,930
What the fuck's the matter with you?

1050
01:10:32,470 --> 01:10:34,520
What do you think you're doin' out there?

1051
01:10:34,630 --> 01:10:35,930
- Huh? - Little slow, that's all.

1052
01:10:36,040 --> 01:10:38,600
- What are you doin' out there? - Take it easy, he'll be all right.

1053
01:10:38,700 --> 01:10:41,870
He's a little slow. He'll make it up, what are ya worried about?

1054
01:10:41,970 --> 01:10:45,540
Goddamn it. Come on, pick it up a little, Jake, I'm sorry.

1055
01:10:45,650 --> 01:10:47,880
Come on, Jake, I got some money on ya!

1056
01:10:48,480 --> 01:10:50,640
- Tank job! - Hit him back, ya bum!

1057
01:10:50,750 --> 01:10:52,050
- Come on. - Hit him back!

1058
01:10:52,990 --> 01:10:55,920
You fuckin' bum! You're takin' a dive in the fourth?

1059
01:10:56,460 --> 01:10:58,550
Pocket your dirty money!

1060
01:11:01,090 --> 01:11:03,720
Aw, you phony bastard! That's a fix!

1061
01:11:03,830 --> 01:11:05,390
We're stoppin' the fight!

1062
01:11:05,970 --> 01:11:09,270
What the fuck are you waitin' for to stop the fight, ya jerk?

1063
01:11:09,840 --> 01:11:10,900
And you standin' there.

1064
01:11:11,010 --> 01:11:14,000
- Fuckin' go down, will ya? - The referee stops this bout

1065
01:11:14,110 --> 01:11:18,810
at 2:23 of the fourth round.

1066
01:11:18,910 --> 01:11:22,310
The winner by technical knockout,

1067
01:11:22,420 --> 01:11:24,580
and still undefeated,

1068
01:11:24,690 --> 01:11:27,680
Billy Fox!

1069
01:11:29,460 --> 01:11:30,920
What'd I do?

1070
01:11:43,140 --> 01:11:44,200
Don't fight anymore.

1071
01:11:44,310 --> 01:11:47,100
It's a free country, don't fight anymore.

1072
01:11:48,480 --> 01:11:52,280
Aw, what'd I do? What'd I do?

1073
01:11:56,650 --> 01:11:58,810
What'd I do?

1074
01:12:05,830 --> 01:12:07,800
- Get outta here! - Jake has an interview...

1075
01:12:09,830 --> 01:12:12,800
It's all right, Jake. It's all right.

1076
01:12:14,840 --> 01:12:17,310
Why did I do it? Why?

1077
01:12:22,910 --> 01:12:25,210
They got some balls, some balls.

1078
01:12:26,450 --> 01:12:28,580
I take the dive. What more do they want?

1079
01:12:29,120 --> 01:12:30,680
They want me to go down, too?

1080
01:12:30,790 --> 01:12:33,260
I ain't goin' down. I ain't goin' down for nobody.

1081
01:12:33,360 --> 01:12:35,990
Why don't you do me a favor? Just put your hands up.

1082
01:12:36,090 --> 01:12:38,390
I wanna show you somethin'. Put your hands up.

1083
01:12:39,630 --> 01:12:43,430
- What the fuck is so hard about that? - Hey, you don't understand.

1084
01:12:44,540 --> 01:12:47,100
I had to fight a bum. He's a bum.

1085
01:12:47,210 --> 01:12:50,110
I fought the guy, I tapped him like that, all of a sudden he's like this

1086
01:12:50,210 --> 01:12:51,840
all over the place, what am I gonna do?

1087
01:12:51,940 --> 01:12:54,040
You don't have to fuckin' pick him up and help him.

1088
01:12:54,150 --> 01:12:55,840
What am I gonna do? If I don't pick him up,

1089
01:12:55,950 --> 01:12:58,180
then what am I gonna do? I'm gonna be in worse trouble.

1090
01:12:58,980 --> 01:13:00,510
I don't know.

1091
01:13:00,620 --> 01:13:03,650
"Purse was withheld... " look at this... "Purse was withheld pending

1092
01:13:03,760 --> 01:13:05,810
D.A.'s probe." Look at that.

1093
01:13:05,920 --> 01:13:08,520
Look how they make me look.

1094
01:13:08,630 --> 01:13:10,650
Like a bum, like a mammalucco.

1095
01:13:11,330 --> 01:13:12,300
A what?

1096
01:13:12,400 --> 01:13:14,660
Like the mammalucco of the year.

1097
01:13:14,770 --> 01:13:16,390
Tommy ain't gonna forget us.

1098
01:13:17,240 --> 01:13:19,800
You're gonna get your shot, as long as he don't die.

1099
01:13:21,010 --> 01:13:23,000
- As long as who don't die? - Tommy.

1100
01:13:23,110 --> 01:13:24,670
What are you talkin' about?

1101
01:13:24,780 --> 01:13:26,680
In other words, Tommy ain't gonna forget ya,

1102
01:13:26,780 --> 01:13:28,010
you're gonna get your shot if he don't die.

1103
01:13:28,110 --> 01:13:30,170
- Gotta make sure the guy stays alive. - He got a disease or somethin'?

1104
01:13:30,280 --> 01:13:32,180
No, I'm just sayin', I'm kiddin', like.

1105
01:13:32,290 --> 01:13:34,050
What's wrong with him? Is somethin' wrong with him?

1106
01:13:34,150 --> 01:13:36,090
There ain't nothin' wrong with him, that's the only way you wouldn't get it

1107
01:13:36,190 --> 01:13:39,090
- is if he dies, he won't be able to... - What are you talkin' like that for?

1108
01:13:47,870 --> 01:13:49,360
What do you want me to do? It's an outdoor arena.

1109
01:13:49,470 --> 01:13:52,270
What do you wanna do, fight in the rain? It's a stadium.

1110
01:13:52,370 --> 01:13:53,960
You waited this long, you can wait longer.

1111
01:13:54,640 --> 01:13:57,110
You wanna wait 24 hours? I don't wanna wait no 24 hours.

1112
01:13:57,210 --> 01:14:00,270
I don't either, but we gotta, so we'll wait. Hello?

1113
01:14:00,980 --> 01:14:04,040
- You guys wanna stop now? - Get off the phone with them.

1114
01:14:04,150 --> 01:14:05,710
Why do you give them the satisfaction?

1115
01:14:05,820 --> 01:14:08,120
- Get off the phone with them! - He don't wanna talk to nobody.

1116
01:14:08,220 --> 01:14:10,380
How many times do we have to tell ya? You hear him yellin'?

1117
01:14:10,490 --> 01:14:13,050
There's enough confusion up here. Please, don't call.

1118
01:14:13,160 --> 01:14:16,460
No comment. Right. Thank you. Bye!

1119
01:14:16,560 --> 01:14:18,560
Pains in the asses, I don't believe them.

1120
01:14:18,670 --> 01:14:21,290
Why do you give them the satisfaction? Why don't you just hang up on 'em?

1121
01:14:21,400 --> 01:14:23,300
- That's all. - I'm gonna get somethin' to eat.

1122
01:14:23,410 --> 01:14:25,530
- What do you want to eat? - I don't want nothin'.

1123
01:14:26,080 --> 01:14:27,200
I don't want nothin'.

1124
01:14:27,310 --> 01:14:29,280
Eat somethin', you gotta eat somethin'.

1125
01:14:31,450 --> 01:14:33,920
You can't go without eatin'. Eat a steak.

1126
01:14:34,020 --> 01:14:36,920
You chew it, you spit it out, you'll still make the weight tomorrow.

1127
01:14:37,620 --> 01:14:39,050
You're worried about that?

1128
01:14:41,290 --> 01:14:43,590
I'll order a steak. At least if you want it, it's here.

1129
01:14:43,690 --> 01:14:45,590
You don't want it, do whatever you want with it.

1130
01:14:45,690 --> 01:14:48,130
- Go ahead. - Vickie, what do you want?

1131
01:14:48,870 --> 01:14:50,700
Order me a piece of cake.

1132
01:14:50,800 --> 01:14:52,700
That's all you want is a piece of cake?

1133
01:14:52,800 --> 01:14:56,430
Why don't you get a cheeseburger, French fries? It's better for you.

1134
01:14:56,540 --> 01:14:58,530
- It's like a whole meal. - Yeah, that's good.

1135
01:14:58,640 --> 01:15:00,110
That's good, order me one of those.

1136
01:15:00,210 --> 01:15:02,140
Wait a minute, what do you want to eat?

1137
01:15:02,250 --> 01:15:04,480
Since when did you order one of those?

1138
01:15:05,250 --> 01:15:06,980
- That's what I want. - It's a free country.

1139
01:15:07,080 --> 01:15:09,210
You order what you want. Don't let nobody influence you.

1140
01:15:09,320 --> 01:15:11,450
I'm not tellin' her what to eat, I was just suggesting.

1141
01:15:11,560 --> 01:15:13,490
What are you tellin' her what to ask for?

1142
01:15:13,590 --> 01:15:16,720
I'm not tellin' her... personally, I don't give a fuck what she eats.

1143
01:15:16,830 --> 01:15:19,460
What were you tellin' her that for?

1144
01:15:19,560 --> 01:15:21,460
Order me a cheeseburger.

1145
01:15:24,440 --> 01:15:27,030
Just order her a cheeseburger, that's all.

1146
01:15:28,240 --> 01:15:29,470
What the f... ?

1147
01:15:29,570 --> 01:15:32,670
What are you guys doin' so long? How long does this thing take to do?

1148
01:15:32,780 --> 01:15:33,740
Forty seconds.

1149
01:15:33,840 --> 01:15:36,410
Forty seconds is no good. You gotta do it in 30 seconds.

1150
01:15:36,520 --> 01:15:38,640
If we gotta stitch him up, that's how much time.

1151
01:15:43,120 --> 01:15:44,250
Ya up?

1152
01:15:44,790 --> 01:15:47,260
- What? - Somebody's here to see ya.

1153
01:15:48,390 --> 01:15:49,760
- Hey, Jack. - Hey, Tommy, how you doin'?

1154
01:15:49,860 --> 01:15:51,160
How are you?

1155
01:15:56,800 --> 01:15:58,600
Say hello to Charlie. Charlie!

1156
01:15:58,700 --> 01:16:01,330
- Jake, how are ya? Lots of luck. - Hello, Charlie, good to see you.

1157
01:16:01,870 --> 01:16:03,170
Thank you.

1158
01:16:04,310 --> 01:16:07,250
- How you feeling? - I'm feelin' all right, thank you.

1159
01:16:07,350 --> 01:16:10,440
- Are you feeling good? - I feel as good as I'm gonna feel.

1160
01:16:10,550 --> 01:16:13,020
I gotta get in there and fight, then I'll know how I'm gonna feel.

1161
01:16:13,120 --> 01:16:16,210
All right. We just come by to wish you luck and all that.

1162
01:16:16,320 --> 01:16:17,790
- Thanks. - You need anything?

1163
01:16:17,890 --> 01:16:19,260
- No. - You sure, nothing?

1164
01:16:19,360 --> 01:16:20,330
No, thank you, Tommy.

1165
01:16:20,430 --> 01:16:22,490
All right. Take care, good luck.

1166
01:16:22,600 --> 01:16:24,290
- God bless ya. - All right, thank you.

1167
01:16:24,400 --> 01:16:26,700
- You'll be all right. - Yeah, I'll be all right.

1168
01:16:27,500 --> 01:16:28,760
See you later, everybody.

1169
01:16:28,870 --> 01:16:30,730
- Vickie, good-bye. - Tommy, wait.

1170
01:16:30,840 --> 01:16:33,310
We really appreciate your comin', I want you to know that.

1171
01:16:33,410 --> 01:16:35,570
It was really nice of you. I appreciate it.

1172
01:16:35,680 --> 01:16:38,540
- Come on, Joey, anytime. - A time like this is very important to him.

1173
01:16:38,650 --> 01:16:40,940
- Anytime. - I just wanted to say good-bye.

1174
01:16:41,050 --> 01:16:43,880
So long, honey. I want you to take good care of that guy, all right?

1175
01:16:43,980 --> 01:16:46,250
- I'll take care of him. - Joey, any little thing,

1176
01:16:46,350 --> 01:16:49,080
I want you to call me. He's very nervous. Ba-boom, call.

1177
01:16:49,190 --> 01:16:50,180
Good-bye, honey.

1178
01:16:51,460 --> 01:16:53,830
Would you look at that face? What a face.

1179
01:16:53,930 --> 01:16:55,590
Can you believe that girl?

1180
01:16:55,700 --> 01:16:58,030
Look at that beauty. Just as beautiful as ever.

1181
01:16:58,130 --> 01:17:00,330
- The least little thing, all right? - Bye-bye, Tommy.

1182
01:17:00,440 --> 01:17:03,890
- So long, everybody. - So long, Tommy.

1183
01:17:13,480 --> 01:17:15,280
Hey! Come here.

1184
01:17:16,050 --> 01:17:17,350
Come here a minute.

1185
01:17:24,760 --> 01:17:26,390
What was all that about?

1186
01:17:27,100 --> 01:17:28,120
All what?

1187
01:17:28,230 --> 01:17:29,990
You know what I'm talkin' about. What was that all about?

1188
01:17:31,770 --> 01:17:34,740
- With him. - Nothin', I just said good-bye.

1189
01:17:34,840 --> 01:17:36,930
All of a sudden you're so friendly with him?

1190
01:17:37,040 --> 01:17:38,740
- I just said good-bye. - You don't do that.

1191
01:17:38,840 --> 01:17:41,210
You say hello, you say good-bye, that's all, ya hear?

1192
01:17:41,310 --> 01:17:42,780
- I hear. - Hey!

1193
01:17:43,380 --> 01:17:46,010
You hear what I said? You don't ever have any disrespect for me.

1194
01:17:46,120 --> 01:17:47,740
You hear what I said?

1195
01:17:49,320 --> 01:17:52,120
- Yeah, I hear. - All right. Go in there.

1196
01:17:53,020 --> 01:17:54,990
- Come here. - Why don't you stop that?

1197
01:17:55,090 --> 01:17:56,720
Shut up, you! Shut up!

1198
01:17:56,830 --> 01:17:59,260
Shut up! I'll fuckin' take care of you later!

1199
01:17:59,360 --> 01:18:00,490
Shut up!

1200
01:18:08,910 --> 01:18:11,370
Disgusted with the two of youse.

1201
01:18:15,910 --> 01:18:17,310
Get to youse later.

1202
01:18:22,450 --> 01:18:24,920
I'm the boss, I'm the boss...

1203
01:18:27,460 --> 01:18:29,260
Hit the fuckin' thing, come on!

1204
01:18:31,300 --> 01:18:32,590
All right, let's go.

1205
01:19:03,500 --> 01:19:05,120
Good luck, Jake!

1206
01:19:44,810 --> 01:19:49,540
For the Middleweight Championship of the World, 15 rounds.

1207
01:19:49,640 --> 01:19:53,210
